    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369100/extras/4d8eb9264ece67296c98425111ba6cdf.avif?t=1743121604\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aimmortal survivor\u300bis a survivor like game based on Chinese Xiu Zhen culture. During the gameplay, players will take on the role of &quot;cultivators&quot; and survive under the siege of monsters. By killing monsters, players can increase their level and strengthen themselves, ultimately surviving to challenge the ultimate boss and achieve victory in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369100/extras/c00200f69bd1b54303f5054e6603eaa8.avif?t=1743121604\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade gives you the opportunity to draw cards and become stronger, with a variety of skills to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369100/extras/81ffbc7c158c0a06401fe2d41312a2fd.avif?t=1743121604\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the level increases, different level realms will be unlocked, providing attribute bonuses and longevity attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369100/extras/c7778d066fa2f5b99a9b4adcabb444de.avif?t=1743121604\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to purchase and experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369100/extras/4d8eb9264ece67296c98425111ba6cdf.avif?t=1743121604\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aimmortal survivor\u300bis a survivor like game based on Chinese Xiu Zhen culture. During the gameplay, players will take on the role of &quot;cultivators&quot; and survive under the siege of monsters. By killing monsters, players can increase their level and strengthen themselves, ultimately surviving to challenge the ultimate boss and achieve victory in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369100/extras/c00200f69bd1b54303f5054e6603eaa8.avif?t=1743121604\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade gives you the opportunity to draw cards and become stronger, with a variety of skills to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369100/extras/81ffbc7c158c0a06401fe2d41312a2fd.avif?t=1743121604\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the level increases, different level realms will be unlocked, providing attribute bonuses and longevity attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369100/extras/c7778d066fa2f5b99a9b4adcabb444de.avif?t=1743121604\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to purchase and experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
